    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "それからその言葉を見るに、酢の売言葉は「スコン」と言ひ、薑の売言葉は「ハジカミコン」といふなど何となく興味がある。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "病牀六尺",
